{"ticker":"PTC","updated":"2026-11-27T23:16:59Z","profile":{"longName":"PTC Inc.","shortName":"PTC Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ptc.com","fullTimeEmployees":7305,"marketCap":21461706752,"trailingPE":22.043673,"forwardPE":19.637947,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":7.8515635,"pegRatio":1.27,"targetMeanPrice":201.7143,"targetHighPrice":205.0,"targetLowPrice":170.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.247,"earningsGrowth":-0.5,"grossMargins":0.83288,"operatingMargins":0.34562,"profitMargins":0.37802,"totalRevenue":2733431040,"beta":0.91,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":197.08,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":108.5,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"PTC Inc. operates as software company in the Americas, Europe, and the Asia Pacific. The company provides Windchill, a suite that manages all aspects of the product development lifecycle(PLM) that provides real-time information sharing, dynamic data visualization, collaborate across geographically distributed teams, and enabling manufacturers to elevate product development, manufacturing, field service, and end-of-life processes; ServiceMax, a service lifecycle management solutions enable companies to asset uptime with optimized in-person and remote service and technician productivity with mobile tools, and deliver metrics; and Arena, a SaaS PLM solution enables product teams to collaborate virtually to share product and quality information with internal teams and supply chain partners and deliver products to customers. It offers Codebeamer, an application lifecycle management for products and software development; Servigistics, a service parts management solution; and FlexPLM, a platform for merchandising and line planning, materials management, sampling, and others. In addition, it offers Creo, a 3D CAD technology enables the digital design, testing, and modification of product models; and Onshape, a SaaS product development platform that delivers computer-aided design with data management, collaboration tools, and real-time analytics. Further, it offers Vuforia, an augmented","summary_zh":"PTC Inc. 作為軟體公司在美洲、歐洲和亞太地區運作。該公司提供 Windchill，這是一個管理產品開發生命週期 (PLM) 各個方面的套件，提供即時資訊共享、動態數據可視化、跨地理分佈的團隊協作，並使製造商能夠提升產品開發、製造、現場服務和報廢流程；ServiceMax 是一種服務生命週期管理解決方案，使公司能夠透過優化的現場和遠端服務來優化資產運作時間，並透過行動裝置運作工具，SLMS，SLMS，SLM.解決方案使產品團隊能夠進行虛擬協作，與內部團隊和供應鏈合作夥伴分享產品和品質訊息，並向客戶交付產品。它提供 Codebeamer，一種用於產品和軟體開發的應用程式生命週期管理； Servigistics，一種服務備件管理解決方案； FlexPLM，一個用於銷售和生產線規劃、材料管理、樣品等的平台。此外，它還提供 Creo，一種 3D CAD 技術，可實現產品模型的數位設計、測試和修改； Onshape，一個 SaaS 產品開發平台，透過資料管理、協作工具和即時分析提供電腦輔助設計。此外，它還提供 Vuforia，一種增強型","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":203.65,"h":204.51,"l":200.83,"c":203.84,"v":569400},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":203.63,"h":204.29,"l":201.81,"c":203.02,"v":1167400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":201.89,"h":204.0,"l":199.16,"c":202.42,"v":775600},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":202.49,"h":203.61,"l":201.45,"c":203.02,"v":586800},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":203.2,"h":204.54,"l":202.57,"c":203.0,"v":588400},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":204.04,"h":205.51,"l":203.14,"c":205.0,"v":811000},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":205.31,"h":206.3,"l":200.69,"c":202.26,"v":566000},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":202.56,"h":204.16,"l":202.04,"c":203.43,"v":569800},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":203.44,"h":203.44,"l":200.39,"c":201.72,"v":627300},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":201.72,"h":203.0,"l":196.61,"c":196.9,"v":585000},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":200.37,"h":203.05,"l":198.55,"c":202.48,"v":687200},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":199.81,"h":203.08,"l":199.67,"c":202.06,"v":534700},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":202.82,"h":204.61,"l":199.87,"c":202.8,"v":861600},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":203.61,"h":203.63,"l":200.09,"c":201.99,"v":589900},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":201.85,"h":203.92,"l":201.49,"c":202.86,"v":673100},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":204.68,"h":206.78,"l":201.89,"c":205.87,"v":667500},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":204.84,"h":206.82,"l":203.59,"c":204.55,"v":623700},{"t":"20